#2401
The Entrance to a Bandit Camp~
   The monotony of the Xixieqi desert's rolling sands is broken here by a grove
of white cloth tents to the south, fenced by closely placed, weathered wooden
stakes. Large poles adorn either side of this gate-like entrance, casting a bit
of a shadow upon the ground on which you stand, a small sanctuary from the
desert's blistering heat.
   A ladder is resting against the right pole, leading up to a lookout nest.
Far above, a yellow flag with the logo of a black boot crushing a snake flies
softly in the wind, the mark of the Xixieqi Bandits.
~
