#2402
The Lookout Nest~
   High above the Xixieqian sands, this lookout point is a prime location for
the bandits to monitor the outside world. The walls of Xixieqi rest atop the
horizon far to the north, and all other directions bear nothing but flat,
rolling desert. From here the sound of the bandit's flag battling against the
wind to remain can be heard quite loudly.
  The only exit that doesn't involve a leap of faith and several broken bones
is back down the ladder.
~
