#2403
Inside the Bandit Camp~
   Now that you're inside the camp, it appears a lot larger than the outside
walls portrayed. You are in a fairly large gap between tents that surround
your eastern and western fronts. The sand here is much softer and cooler than
the sand outside of the camp, likely due to it being well-trodden.
   Directly ahead of you, the path is staggered by training dummies, spread
evenly throughout. Travel is possible north, east, west, and weaving through
the dummies, southward.
