#2405
Inside a Small Tent~
   This tent appears to be the bed-quarters of some of the bandits.
Sleeping bags made of some kind of animal fur lie on the ground here,
suitable for those cold desert nights. A few chairs are scattered about,
and miscellaneous goods rest on the cloth strewn across the sand
here. The only entry/exit point from this tent is to the west.
