#2408
the Center of the Camp~
   For some reason, your intuition tells you this is the exact center of the
encampment. A sole training dummy sticks up from the ground here, far
separated from the others to his north. A refreshingly cool, slow wind hovers
overhead, and you're glad this oft-traveled and well-packed sand will not be
stirred so easily. To the north resides the entrance to the camp and more
dummies, to the south a narrow walk between two tents, while east and west
continue this outdoor segment of the bandit outpost.
~
