#2409
Within the Bandit Camp~
   You're in a particularly uninhabited area of the camp. A cactus protrudes
from the sand here, but it was most likely preserved because of laziness, 
not for the beauty-of-nature factor.  A lone flower blooms atop the cactus, as
if to symbolize some form of beauty amongst the thorns that inhabit this 
outpost. But probably not. A large tent inhabits your west, and all other
paths are plausible, save the south, blocked by a tent.
