#2410
The Mess Tent~
   This looks like the tent where the bandits have their meals. A long table
stretches the distance of this partition of the tent, covered with nearly
empty plates and dirtied utensils. From the west wafts the smell of ... 
something.  The benches beneath the tables are barren now, and the plates
have been left on the table for the dogs to clean. You still cannot place the
scent of whatever is being cooked to your west, but it seems remotely
familiar. The tent continues west to a second partition where the cook
resides. The east leads out to the courtyard area of the camp.
~
