#2411
The Chef's Area~
   Various, scattered cooking tools characterize this end of the tent, the
most significant being a large pot above a fire, from which emanates the smell
you detected previously, along with a lot of smoke. The tent is considerably
hotter here, and understandably so. A rack of knives is sitting in place along
the southern tent wall. The partition flaps open to the mess hall room to the 
east.
