#2412
An Intersection within the Camp~
   You stand in the middle of a narrow four-way intersection in the camp. A 
melange of sounds infiltrates your ears. From the east, the telltale
hammering of a blacksmith, while the tent west from here assaults you with
loud barking. The huge tent to the south contributes to the noisy confusion
with chattering voices. The top of the southern tent bears a flag similar to
the one at the gate of this encampment.
~
