#2413
The Bandit's Armorer~
   This small tent is overcrowded with all sorts of tools. Anything you can
think of that anyone might ever utilize as a smithy, this tent has, lining its
walls. There is a large workbench supporting the far wall, covered in half
completed weapon and armor projects. A blazing heat rushes across your
feet, and you note it to be coming from a small stone furnace. An intersection
in the camp to be seen outside the tent, looking westward.
~
