#2414
The Kennel Tent~
   This room reeks of.. Dog. It is where the bandits keep their ever valued
attack dogs, handy for catching those nasty little stragglers, or just plain
scaring people. Large meat bones lie discarded all around the room, and
the corners of the tent are covered in dog fur, in addition to other dog
byproducts. A stake is in the ground at the middle of the room, for tying dogs
to.
   Further inspection shows that the rope gives them enough slack to easily
tear you apart from anywhere within the tent. Reassuring, no? With that in
mind, the only exit, the opening of the tent to the east, looks quite
appealing.
~
