#2415
The Main Tent~
   You're in the first partition of a huge tent thats been separated into
sections. This first room serves as an entry, mostly, with a rack to hang
your cloak and room underneath it for boots. Any sand that might have been
tracked in stops here. The north leads outside of the tent, while the west is
accessible, though not visible through the flaps creating this partition of
the tent.
