#2416
The Loot Depository~
   This section of the tent is where bandits drop off whatever they've
"acquired", for storage. A few currently flat booty-stashing bags have been
scattered around here, ready to be picked up for storage use in a moment's
notice. Looking around you see nothing but junk, and certainly nothing
worth even taking notice of, save a large chest which appears to be locked.
   The entrance to this tent is through the flap to the east, and this room
continues to the south, to what seems to be a large table.
~
