#2417
The Bandit Planning Area~
   A long wooden table covered in maps and other assorted papers is in
the middle of the tent here. Writing sloppy enough to appear as a different
language covers some maps, while others are completely untouched. They seem to
cover all sorts of areas, from sections of the Xixieqi desert to all of the
secret entrances and guard bypasses of the Xixieqi city itself. Beyond the
table, there really isn't anything worth noting. The room extends north, and a
flap separates yet another room to the south.
~
