#2418
Bandit Sleeping Quarters~
   This is where the higher-ranking bandits sleep. Fine animal skin sleeping
bags line the floor, allowing only a small amount of area to navigate.
Beside each bag reside a few small personal belongings per person. A lot
of strange boards have been fashioned, one can only assume they are for
different types of games. Apparently, the bandits don't have much to 
entertain themselves when they're not killing and stealing, so they recreate
by making and playing games.
   The sleeping quarters can be exited to the north and east, but the eastern
flap seems a bit more decorated than the northern one.
~
