#2419
Brianna's Quarters~
   Who would've thought the leader of the notorious Xixieqi bandits was a 
woman? It is kept fairly well hidden from the public, as all bandits are
covered almost entirely when they go into public, but this fact hasn't
affected the success of the bandits any. A fine bed resting upon a wooden
frame rests here, with two night tables beside it. On one you see a mirror
and what looks to be a novel, but you don't recognize it.  On the other lies a
hairbrush, tangled with hair and tattered with use over the years.
   A flap lies to your east, with a complex design sewn upon it in hopes of
making it look different from all of the other flaps in the tent.
~
